title: "Feasibility and Deployment Analysis of Wi-Fi-Based Human Activity Recognition on a Memory-Constrained Microcontroller: code, firmware, and results"
abstract: >-
  Code, executed notebooks, on-device measurement firmware, measured results, and
  trained models for a deployment study of Wi-Fi CSI human activity recognition on
  the classic PSRAM-less ESP32: classical learners, tiny neural networks, and five
  deep architectures, with measured on-device memory, latency, and energy, a live
  capture-to-prediction pipeline, and a cross-subject generalization analysis.
